@model ReformedHistory.Views.Content.Confessions.Secret.SecretSection

<h2 id="@this.Model.Link">Chapter @this.Model.Index</h2>
<h3>@this.Model.Name</h3>
<br />

<div class="centerQuote">
    <span>
        No one can have God as his Father who does not have the Church as his mother
    </span>
    <span>Saint Cyprian, On the Unity of the Church</span>
</div>
    
<ol>
    <li>
        The church is the body of Christ on Earth: the covenant community, the communion of saints, and the
        house of God.
    </li>
    <li>
        The church does not subsist in any one human institution, but in every place the faith of Christ and 
        the apostles has been rightly transmitted through the holy ministry, the preaching of the word, and
        the administration of the sacraments.
    </li>
    <li>
        Though there are many particular churches across nations, and many schisms within nations, there are not
        many churches but one church. Christ cannot be divided
    </li>
</ol>
<br />